        BfgsVerification.dot v
            (Matrix.mulVec (BfgsVerification.RadialHessian.matrix (BfgsVerification.LEmbedding.branch i.castSucc) x)
              v) ≤
          BfgsVerification.LEmbedding.gradientBound i * BfgsVerification.sqNorm v
